oundCount($value): int","+    {","+        if (!self::shouldRoundValue($value)) {","+            return (int) $value;","+        }","+","+        return self::roundToNearestTen((float) $value);","+    }","+","     private static function roundToNearestTen(float $value): int","     {","         if ($value === 0.0) {"],"additions":16,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"plugins/PrivacyManager/tests/System/expected/test___PrivacyManager.getCompliancePolicySettings.xml","lines":["@@ -56,6 +56,16 @@"," \t\t\t<toggleable>1</toggleable>"," \t\t\t<section>settings</section>"," \t\t</row>","+\t\t<row>","+\t\t\t<id>Live.AggregatedRealtimeReportsEnabled</id>","+\t\t\t<name>Aggregated Real-time Reports Enabled</name>","+\t\t\t<whatItDoes>Aggregated real-time reports stay available while the Visits Log is turned off.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only the &quot;Last 24 hours&quot; and &quot;Last 30 minutes&quot; totals are shown, and their counts are rounded, so no individual visitor, visit, session or action level information is exposed.</whatItDoes>","+\t\t\t<impact>&lt;strong&gt;Visitors &gt; Real-time&lt;/strong&gt; shows the aggregated counters only, with rounded counts.</impact>","+\t\t\t<status>non_compliant</status>","+\t\t\t<enforced>0</enforced>","+\t\t\t<toggleable>1</toggleable>","+\t\t\t<section>settings</section>","+\t\t</row>"," \t\t<row>"," \t\t\t<id>Live.VisitorLogDisabled</id>"," \t\t\t<name>Visits Log and Visitor Profiles Disabled</name>"],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"plugins/PrivacyManager/tests/System/expected/test___PrivacyManager.getComplianceStatus.xml","lines":["@@ -28,6 +28,11 @@"," \t\t\t<value>non_compliant</value>"," \t\t\t<notes>Personally Identifiable Information (PII) data must be filtered by the Matomo-recommended PII exclusion list.</notes>"," \t\t</row>","+\t\t<row>","+\t\t\t<name>Aggregated Real-time Reports Enabled</name>","+\t\t\t<value>non_compliant</value>","+\t\t\t<notes>Aggregated real-time reports are required to b